       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. AVERAGE-CALC.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 NUMBERS.
           05 NUM1 PIC 9(4).
           05 NUM2 PIC 9(4).
           05 NUM3 PIC 9(4).
           05 NUM4 PIC 9(4).
           05 NUM5 PIC 9(4).
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
       01 AVERAGE PIC 9(4)V9(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DISPLAY "Enter 5 numbers: ".
           ACCEPT NUM1.
           ACCEPT NUM2.
           ACCEPT NUM3.
           ACCEPT NUM4.
           ACCEPT NUM5.

           COMPUTE TOTAL = NUM1 + NUM2 + NUM3 + NUM4 + NUM5.
           COMPUTE AVERAGE = TOTAL / 5.

           DISPLAY "The average is: " AVERAGE.
           DISPLAY "Hii".

           STOP RUN.
